      "snippet": {
        "line": 2666,
        "text": "theorem compact_weighted_jet_bound {V : Type} [NormedAddCommGroup V] [NormedSpace ℝ V]\n    {f : Inner → V} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) {zeta : Inner → ℝ} (hz : Continuous zeta)\n    {K : Set Inner} (hK : IsCompact K) (hp : ∀ w ∈ K, 0 < zeta w) (m : ℕ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∀ w ∈ K, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f w‖ ≤ C * zeta w"
      }
    }
  }
}
